  "stageId": "main_04-06",
  "title": "Ignorance",
  "storyCode": "4-6",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6e4043ebf5983fa7dae83161596a8d7b5586a92a5b1a4ceda127883e055e4eb1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "We've arrived."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...What a depressing place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Any mention of this on the news?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "None."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "By the looks of things, Ursus decided to abandon this place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "A deserted city, huh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "It this city has already become a Reunion stronghold, it's only going to cause more and more problems for Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "It's too close to Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "But if Skullshatterer was taking commands from this place, we can't afford to ignore it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "But... what exactly happened to this part of Chernobog?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "It's impossible for it to have moved this far after being hit by the Catastrophe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "And why would it appear here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "From the observation data we've gathered... this happened in the aftermath of the Catastrophe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Which means that this subsection was destroyed only after it reached here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Hah. Seems like Rhodes Island has some skilled Catastrophe Messengers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "It's good to be cautious."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "We've been ambushed by poorly-organized thugs our entire way here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Like vultures circling overhead, looking for carcasses among the ruins."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "It makes my skin crawl."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I've confirmed the coordinates. We'll have to continue moving deeper--"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "But judging from the terrain, we won't be able to move all our forces together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Are we approaching the Originium-dense parts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(I didn't expect you to be here.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Ch'en, what do you think..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Ch'en?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "How..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Ch'en, where are you going?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Damn it, she just took off running! Who could that have been..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...I didn't manage to get a good look either!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "But that silhouette seemed like..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "We have to follow her..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Stop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "What bad timing...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "That guy is no ordinary henchman..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "And... where did all of those Originium slugs crawl out from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Those creatures... look like they might explode!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Dr. {@nickname}!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Make sure our operators exercise utmost caution!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
